This implementation uses a bubble sort algorithm, which has a time complexity of O(n²). For better performance, I recommend the following optimizations:

1. **Use QuickSort Algorithm**: QuickSort has an average time complexity of O(n log n), which is significantly faster than bubble sort for large arrays.

2. **Implement in-place sorting**: This reduces memory usage and improves cache performance.

